<title>FRANCE: CSFB reiterates &quot;buy&quot; on AXA.</title>
<headline>CSFB reiterates &quot;buy&quot; on AXA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kishore Banger, insurance analyst at CSFB in London, said on Tuesday he was maintaining his &quot;buy&quot; advice on AXA, which last month announced it was to merge with fellow French insurer UAP, and had a price target of 400 francs.</p>
<p>&quot;I've had a &quot;buy&quot; out since the merger announcement. Because the share swap is ending tomorrow I've updated the story,&quot; Banger said by telephone.</p>
<p>The share swap offer on UAP will close at 1600 GMT on Wednesday and the SBF stock markets association will announce the result of the offer on January 13.</p>
</text>
